    {
      "target": "계약서에는 법적 책임이 적혀 있어요.",
      "reading": "Gyeyakseoe-neun beopjeok chaegimi jeokhyeo isseoyo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "The contract states the legal responsibility.",
        "ko": "계약서에는 법적 책임이 적혀 있어요.",
        "ipa": "Gyeyakseoe-neun beopjeok chaegimi jeokhyeo isseoyo.",
        "ar": "ينصّ العقد على المسؤولية القانونية.",
        "cs": "Ve smlouvě je uvedena právní odpovědnost.",
        "da": "Kontrakten angiver det juridiske ansvar.",
